2. Country-level IP geolocation database — plugin/assets/data/
------------------------------------------------------------------

Files:
  assets/data/gr-geoip-v4.bin    (IPv4 ranges, 9 bytes each: start,
                                  end, country index)
  assets/data/gr-geoip-v6.bin    (IPv6 ranges, 33 bytes each)
  assets/data/gr-geoip.json      (country table, range counts,
                                  build date, provenance)

Source:   DB-IP — https://db-ip.com/
          free "Country Lite" database

License:  CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
          Attribution requirement is met by this notice and the
          plugin readme's Attribution section; no additional
          restrictions apply.

The CSV was repacked into the plugin's fixed-width binary format by
tools/pack-geoip.php; the country data itself is unchanged. The
admin update button refreshes these files from the same source; the
refresh writes to the uploads directory and never modifies the
plugin directory.

Data date: 2026-09 (357,325 IPv4 ranges, 359,845 IPv6 ranges, 251
country codes, including the reserved-address code ZZ). Later
refreshes record their own date in gr-geoip.json; this notice states
the date of the copy bundled with the release.

