4. MaxMind GeoLite2 country database — deliberately NOT bundled
------------------------------------------------------------------

The optional GeoLite2 Country database (MaxMind, https://www.maxmind.com/)
is NOT distributed inside this plugin package, and this section
states that absence as a matter of record: the GeoLite2 EULA
(https://www.maxmind.com/en/geolite/eula) forbids redistribution,
so no mmdb file ships here and none ever will.

How it arrives: the site owner enters their own MaxMind license key
on the IP Intelligence page and clicks the download button. The
plugin then sends that license key to MaxMind's download endpoint
(the only request it makes for this feature, no visitor data
involved) and writes the received database into the site's own
uploads directory. The owner may delete it there at any time; the
bundled DB-IP Lite country data keeps answering lookups regardless.

Origin and ownership of that file remain MaxMind's under the
GeoLite2 EULA between MaxMind and the downloading site owner; the
plugin only stores and reads it locally. This notice therefore
carries no MaxMind attribution obligation of its own, and lists
this section so the absence of bundled MaxMind data is stated
where a reviewer would look for it.
